OL,3,GNEWSAMother sentenced for killing son
OL,4,Aand attempting to murder daughter
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman, whose convictions for the
OL,7,Fmurder of her baby son and attempted
OL,8,Fmurder of his toddler sister were
OL,9,Fquashed, has been sentenced to 10 years
OL,10,Ffor infanticide and attempted murder.
OL,12,FThe woman stabbed both children in July
OL,13,F2021 and they were taken to the Royal
OL,14,FBelfast Hospital for Sick Children.
OL,16,FThe girl was successfully treated but
OL,17,Fthe baby boy was pronounced dead.
OL,19,FThe woman was convicted and jailed in
OL,20,F2023 for murdering her eight-week-old
OL,21,Fson and attempting to murder his
OL,22,Ftoddler sister.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
